WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:05.379
Who would win: The Hard to Destroy Reptile,
or 9.15 million kilograms of bananas?

00:00:05.379 --> 00:00:09.920
This is SCP-682 VS SCP-3521

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:15.450
When SCP-682 was cross-tested with SCP-3521
- A little yellow pill that makes bananas

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.920
manifest in the stomach of those who eat them
- the Foundation hoped to answer that question.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.240
682 was tricked into eating the pill by hiding
it inside the body of a dead cow, which was

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.640
then fed to the monster.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:31.240
As time passed, an absurd number of bananas
began to manifest in and around SCP-682, filling

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.600
its containment chamber and then the entire
facility.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.140
However, just when it seemed 682 was crushed
under all that potassium, it began eating

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.530
the bananas faster than they could be produced.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:45.520
And because bananas are each slightly naturally
radioactive, eating that many gave SCP-682

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:50.450
the ability to fire a powerful radiation beam
out of its mouth until 3521’s effects wore

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.450
off.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:52.450
The craziest part?

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.149
This all occurred within a ten-minute period.

00:00:54.149 --> 00:00:56.700
Guess you could say things went a little bananas
in there.

